note Applies a TourEdit to one tour as a single edit: on a copy of the map, the kept steps' notes, the removals, the added steps (add_steps_under), then kind, group, tour note and last the rename (every earlier call names the tour by its old name); the copy replaces the map only when every part succeeded, so a refusal leaves the map as it was. The edit-tour page's apply (feature-edit-tour).

