note Creates a whole tour in one edit, as the build-tour wizard's create does: the name must be free, then the tour, its group, its note and its steps (hung from the tree entries the human kept, through the same hang promote uses) are built on a clone, which replaces the map only when every part succeeded. A refusal anywhere leaves the map as it was.
